title: Commvault MediaAgent %s
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Checks the status of one Commvault MediaAgent as reported by the CommServe
 (GET /V4/MediaAgent). ONLINE is OK. OFFLINE is CRIT, except offline reason
 code 0 ("No errors detected"), which is WARN. Unlicensed MediaAgents are WARN.
 The version and the query time are shown; the API reports no timestamp of
 its own. All states are configurable in the "Commvault MediaAgents" ruleset.

item:
 The MediaAgent name.

discovery:
 One service per MediaAgent.
